SismoNexo Colombia · Atlas of seismic activity and probabilistic forecasting
SismoNexo Colombia is an academic prototype that organises the public seismic catalogue of the Colombian Geological Survey and estimates, by zone and period, the probability of recording activity above a magnitude threshold. It does not predict individual earthquakes or issue alerts.
